                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/happy-lesson/episodes/148173",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Dizzying * The Big Transformation of Her Dreams!",
                        "jpn": null
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Chitose's Mom Kisaragi does an open experiment on herself to improve herself. The next day Kisaragi takes the characterization of Yayoi, then Satsuki, then Uzuki, then Mitsuki. Then later tells Chitose about it. Will she ever come back to normal?",
